        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kalvary ching ngampui luangbut,",
            "Kauh rimei guai rui thuanku e,",
            "Meiguai rui ni thuanku puni,",
            "Kanloumeipu zei luangkeina",
            "Maan kan nimei tiring dat the",
            "Houmumei guai pap kuaklou the.",
            "",
            "2. Ching kapum khang suang kalvary,",
            "Katik kagun dai tap-tap be",
            "Khou tei kanloumei zei luang e,",
            "Kandi ram khouhei luangkei e",
            "Mei heizumei pap kuaklou the,",
            "Tingsaengzaeng ring nipui dui e.",
            "",
            "3. Pap kuak puibam kalvary ching,",
            "Meiguai na pap khang theilou the,",
            "Theinimei bumang kanlou khang",
            "Kros rukhou kazei luang keilou,",
            "Hang ringmei pap heizumei tei,",
            "Kazeirui gunh kum khiu phuanlou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
